  "text": {
    "status": "generated",
    "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p>Wegovy Prior Approval Request (FEP)</p><ol><li>Is this request for brand or generic?</li><li>Injection (single-dose pens): Will the patient need more than 12 single-dose pens every 84 days?</li><li>Tablets: Will the patient need more than 90 tablets every 90 days?</li><li>1. What is the patient&#39;s diagnosis?</li><li>2. Has the patient participated in a comprehensive weight management program such as Teladoc or another weight loss program?</li><li>3. Is the patient currently using another glucagon-like peptide-1 (GLP-1) receptor agonist? Please select answer below.</li><li>4. Will this medication be used in combination with another *Prior Authorization (PA) medication for weight loss?</li><li>6. Blue Standard / Blue Basic Patient: Is this medication being requested as a change from Zepbound?</li><li>7. a. This is a non-formulary medication. Please provide all formulary alternative medication(s) that have been tried and failed. Please answer below:</li><li>5. Has the patient been on this medication continuously for the last 4 months excluding samples? Please select answer below:</li><li>a. Age 12-17: What is the patient&#39;s body mass index (BMI) percentile for their age? Please select answer below:</li><li>b. i. Age 18 or older: What is the patient&#39;s body mass index (BMI) in kilograms per square meter (kg/m2)? Please select answer below:</li><li>ii. If BMI is between 27 kg/m2 and 29.9 kg/m2: Does the patient have ONE of the listed weight related comorbid conditions OR established cardiovascular disease? Please select answer below:</li><li>a. Age 12-17: Has the patient maintained clinically significant weight loss?</li><li>b. Age 18 or older: Has the patient lost at least 5 percent of their baseline body weight?</li><li>* If NO, has the patient continued to maintain their initial 5 percent weight loss?</li></ol></div>"
  },
